OL,3,GNEWSAMini music festival celebrates    
OL,4,ASouth Asian culture                    
OL,6,FA music charity is staging its first   
OL,7,F"mini festival" celebrating South Asian
OL,8,Fculture.                               
OL,10,FMusic at Oxford kicks off in the city  
OL,11,Flater and will feature tabla playing,  
OL,12,Fdance workshops, music from the Sufi   
OL,13,Ftradition and an Indian film screening.
OL,15,FArtistic and executive director,       
OL,16,FRebecca Dawson, said the short         
OL,17,Fweekend-long festival format gave      
OL,18,Fpeople a chance to learn more about the
OL,19,Fculture at venues including the        
OL,20,FSheldonian Theatre.                    
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
