OL,3,GNEWSAMini music festival celebrates    
OL,4,ASouth Asian culture                    
OL,6,FDawson said all the concerts would have
OL,7,Fspecial decoration, lighting and       
OL,8,Famplification to make for "a really,   
OL,9,Freally authentic South Asian           
OL,10,Fexperience".                           
